          "type": "UNetDriver*",
          "default": "nullptr"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Inititalize the NetDriver to be used for the server connection handshake.\nIf InNetDriver is null then a new NetDriver will be created in the world using the\nNAME_GameNetDriver driver definition.\nIf InNetDriver is not null then it's expected that the NetDriver passed in has only\nbeen created and has not begun listening for connections or connecting to a remote\nserver."
